
## 1. `employees`

Employee ki identity/profile information. **Salary yahan nahi hogi.**

```text
employees
──────────────
id                 PK
employee_code      UNIQUE
first_name
last_name
email              UNIQUE
phone
date_of_birth
date_of_joining
gender
address
bank_account_id    FK → bank_accounts.id   [optional]
status             ENUM(ACTIVE, INACTIVE, TERMINATED)
created_at
updated_at
```

> `wage`, `salary_structure_id`, `contract_id` etc. employee mein **nahi**.

