# 4. `contracts`

Ye employee ke **employment terms for a particular period** hain.

```text
contracts
──────────────
id                       PK
employee_id              FK → employees.id
position_id              FK → job_positions.id
department_id            FK → departments.id

employment_type          ENUM(FULL_TIME, PART_TIME, CONTRACT)
start_date
end_date                 NULL

wage                     DECIMAL(15,2)

salary_structure_id      FK → salary_structures.id
working_schedule_id      FK → working_schedules.id

status                   ENUM(DRAFT, ACTIVE, EXPIRED, TERMINATED, CANCELLED)

termination_date         NULL
termination_reason       NULL

created_at
updated_at
```

Example:

```text
Employee A
Software Engineer
₹10 LPA
Regular Structure
01-01-2026 → 31-12-2026
```

Employee B:

```text
Employee B
Software Engineer
₹11 LPA
Regular Structure
01-01-2026 → 31-12-2026
```

Same position + same structure, **different contract wage**.

