# 7. `attendance`

Actual employee attendance.

```text
attendance
──────────────
id                 PK
employee_id        FK → employees.id
date

check_in           NULL
check_out          NULL

worked_minutes
status             ENUM(PRESENT, ABSENT, HALF_DAY, LATE, ON_LEAVE)

remarks

created_at
updated_at

UNIQUE(employee_id, date)
```

Important:

```text
Working Schedule = expected
Attendance       = actual
```

`worked_minutes` system calculate karega based on check-in/out + schedule/break.

