# 10. `time_off_requests`

Employee ki actual leave request.

```text
time_off_requests
───────────────────
id                 PK
employee_id        FK → employees.id
time_off_type_id   FK → time_off_types.id
allocation_id      FK → time_off_allocations.id NULL

start_date
end_date

requested_amount

reason

status             ENUM(PENDING, APPROVED, REJECTED, CANCELLED)

approved_by        FK → users.id NULL
approved_at        NULL

created_at
updated_at
```

Flow:

```text
Allocation
    ↓
Employee requests leave
    ↓
Request
    ↓
Approved
    ↓
Allocation consumed
```

