# 13. `salary_rules`

Actual calculation definitions.

```text
salary_rules
──────────────
id                 PK
name
code               UNIQUE

category_id        FK → salary_rule_categories.id

sequence           INTEGER

calculation_type   ENUM(
                     FIXED,
                     PERCENTAGE,
                     FORMULA
                   )

value              DECIMAL(15,4) NULL
formula            TEXT NULL

status             ENUM(ACTIVE, INACTIVE)

created_at
updated_at
```

Examples:

```text
Basic
code = BASIC
calculation_type = PERCENTAGE
value = 60
```

```text
HRA
code = HRA
calculation_type = PERCENTAGE
formula/value based on BASIC
```

```text
PF
code = PF
calculation_type = PERCENTAGE
value = 12
```

**Important:** engine ko `if code == "HRA"` type hardcoding nahi karni.

