# 14. `salary_structure_rules`

Salary Structure ↔ Salary Rules ka **many-to-many relationship**.

```text
salary_structure_rules
───────────────────────
id                    PK

salary_structure_id   FK → salary_structures.id
salary_rule_id        FK → salary_rules.id

sequence              INTEGER

created_at

UNIQUE(
    salary_structure_id,
    salary_rule_id
)
```

Example:

```text
Regular Structure
       │
       ├── Basic
       ├── HRA
       ├── Special Allowance
       ├── PF
       └── Net
```

Is table ki wajah se ek salary rule ko multiple structures mein reuse kar sakte ho.

